TEXT 1016 -160 Left 2 !* Enter Design Goals Information Here *\n*\n.param fc=1k ; targeted crossover *\n.param Gfc=-20 ; gain at crossover\n.param boost=60 ; select phase boost at crossover\n*\n*\n* Enter the Values for Vout and Bridge Bias Current *\n*\n.param Vout=12\n.param Ibias=250u\n.param Vref=2.5\n*\n* Do not edit the below lines *\n*\n.param Rlower={Vref/Ibias}\n.param Rupper={(Vout-Vref)/Ibias}\n.param  kdiv=Rlower/(Rlower+Rupper)\n.param G={10**(-Gfc/20)}\n \n.param fz={tan(pi/2-boost*pi/180)*fc}\n.param a={G*2*pi*fc}\n.param b={1+(fc/fz)**2}\n.param Wpo={a/sqrt(b)}\n.param fpo={Wpo/(2*pi)}\n.param C1={1/(Wpo*Rupper)}\n.param R2={1/(fz*2*pi*C1)}\n*\n* PI parameters\n*\n.param Ti={R2*C1}\n.param kp={Wpo*ti}\n*
TEXT 552 -168 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 10 100k
